      "@type": "Resource",
      "name": "Permutation Importance vs Random Forest Feature Importance (MDI) — scikit-learn",
      "citationKey": "PermutationImportanceVs",
      "url": "https://scikit-learn.org/stable/auto_examples/inspection/plot_permutation_importance.html",
      "sourceType": "tutorial",
      "abstract": "In this example, we will compare the impurity-based feature importance of RandomForestClassifier with the permutation importance on the titanic dataset using permutation_importance. We will show th..."
    },
